                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote1" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 1"><sup>1</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>Hyperscalers in this context refers narrowly to Alphabet Inc. and Amazon.com.</p></div>
                </div>
    </div>
